  "description": {
   "en": "Chris, caught in a suicide bombing carried out by escaped death row inmates, finds himself reincarnated in a world of swords and magic. Determined not to lead another miserable life, he resolves to make the most of his innate special abilities. However, he soon discovers that the death row inmates have also been reincarnated into this world...!?",
